Kernel_setValidNonceFrom
├── when caller is not EntryPoint
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized error
└── when caller is EntryPoint or self
    ├── given seq is less than or equal to current validNonceFrom
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidNonce error
    └── given seq is greater than current validNonceFrom
        └── it should update validNonceFrom to seq
